Indian five princes touching elders' feet, before leaving in chariots, oil painting in the style of Raja Ravi Varma, rich pigments, soft chiaroscuro, reverent, ancient Puranic-era palace courtyard at dawn of low carved-stone and timber buildings, clay-tile roofs, soft golden light, wide horizontal composition with the subject left of centre and open space on the right, a purely visual image, every surface plain and unmarked.